Text in sentences.jsonl in this directory is taken from books published by
Fundacja Wolne Lektury (https://wolnelektury.pl/). The literary works used are
in the PUBLIC DOMAIN (each source file states "Ten utwór jest w domenie
publicznej"). Only the work text is used; Wolne Lektury's additional materials
(footnotes, motifs), licensed under the Free Art License 1.3
(https://artlibre.org/licence/lal/pl/), are not included.

Attribution (requested by Wolne Lektury, https://wolnelektury.pl/info/zasady-wykorzystania/):
source: Wolne Lektury, Fundacja Wolne Lektury (formerly Fundacja Nowoczesna Polska).
Each line records the author, title, the book page URL and the printed edition
the digital text is based on (edition). Only editions published in 1950 or later,
in modern orthography, were used.

Changes: the text was split into sentences, filtered (dialogue, quotations,
archaic spellings, foreign-language and short/long sentences removed) and
normalised to Unicode NFC.
